        "original_id": "d4f03c6a-a9ae-55ef-aec4-36e0689240d5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Beauty and the Geek, Beauty and the Beast\n- People: Ashton Kutcher, Jason Goldberg, Nick Santora, Gabrielle-Suzanne Barbot de Villeneuve\n- Concepts: The Ultimate Social Experiment, parody, fairy tale\n- Works: La Jeune Américaine et les contes marins\n\nFacts:\n- In 1740, Gabrielle-Suzanne Barbot de Villeneuve published the fairy tale Beauty and the Beast in La Jeune Américaine et les contes marins.\n- Beauty and the Beast is a traditional fairy tale whose French title is La Belle et la Bête.\n- The title of Beauty and the Geek is a parody of the title Beauty and the Beast.\n- Beauty and the Geek has been advertised as \"The Ultimate Social Experiment.\"\n- Beauty and the Geek was produced by Ashton Kutcher, Jason Goldberg, and Nick Santora.",
